        '          '#39'ul teeth.  They are voracious eaters, and divers repo' +
        'rt seeing t'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'he clown \b triggerfish \b0 devour beds of pearl oyst' +
        'ers.\par'#39'#13#10'#39'\'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'par'#39'#13#10'#39'Do not eat this fish.  According to an 187' +
