        '          '#39'rwards all the muscles of the body.  The frame become' +
        's rocked wi'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'th spasms, the tongue thickened, the eye fixed, the b' +
        'reathing la'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'borious, and the patient expires in a paroxysm of ext' +
        'reme suffer'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'ing."\par'#39'#13#10'#39'\par'#39'#13#10'#39'Not edible.\par'#39'#13#10'#39'\' +
