        '          '#39'rset204 Tahoma;}}'#39'#13#10'#39'\viewkind4\uc1\pard\f0\fs16 ' +
        'Called seaperch i'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'n Australia.  Inhabits the areas around lagoon coral ' +
        'reefs and s'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'andy bottoms.\par'#39'#13#10'#39'\par'#39'#13#10'#39'The \b red emper' +
        'or\b0  is a valuable fo'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'od fish and considered a great sporting fish that fig' +
        'hts with fu'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'ry when hooked.  The flesh of an old fish is just as ' +
        'tender to e'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'at as that of the very young.\par'#39'#13#10'#39'\par'#39'#13#10'#39 +
        'Range is from the Indo-'#39' +'
      '          '#39'Pacific to East Africa.\par'#39'#13#10'#39'}'#39')'
