        ' color changes dr'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'amatically from juvenile to adult.  The mature adult ' +
        'fish can st'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'artle divers by producing a powerful drumming or thum' +
        'ping sound '#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'intended to warn off predators.'#39'#10#10'#39'Edibility is g' +
        'ood.'#39'#10#10'#39'Range is th'#39' +'
      '          '#39'e entire Indo-Pacific region.'#39'#10'
