        'Habitat is around'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39' boulders, caves, coral ledges and crevices in shallo' +
        'w waters.  '#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'Swims alone or in groups.\par'#39'#13#10'#39'\par'#39'#13#10'#39'Its ' +
        'color changes dramatica'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'lly from juvenile to adult.  The mature adult fish ca' +
        'n startle d'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'ivers by producing a powerful drumming or thumping so' +
        'und intende'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'd to warn off predators.\par'#39'#13#10'#39'\par'#39'#13#10'#39'Edibi' +
        'lity is good.\par'#39'#13#10'#39'\par'#39' +'
      
        '          #13#10'#39'Range is the entire Indo-Pacific region.\par'#39'#1' +
        '3#10'#39'}'#39')'
