      '        '
      
        '          '#39'Also known as the coronation trout.  It is found arou' +
        'nd coral re'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'efs from shallow to very deep waters.  Feeds primaril' +
        'y on small '#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'fishes.'#39'#10#10'#39'Although this rockcod is considered a ' +
        'good game and foo'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'd fish, the large ones may contain a toxin and should' +
        ' not be eat'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'en.  There is no way to discern whether the fish cont' +
        'ains toxin.'#39' +'
      '          #10#10'#39'Range is the Indo-Pacific and the Red Sea.'#39'#10'
