        '          '#39'Also known as the turkeyfish.  Inhabits reef caves an' +
        'd crevices.'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'  The firefish is usually stationary during the day, ' +
        'but feeds a'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'ctively at night.  Favorite foods are crustaceans.'#39'#1' +
        '0#10'#39'The dorsal s'#39' +'
      
