        '          '#39'olyps and anemones.'#39'#10#10'#39'Edibility is poor.'#39'#10#10'#39 +
        'Range is Indo-Pacific f'#39' +'
      '          '#39'rom Sri Lanka to Polynesia.'#39'#10'
