        '          '#39'Widely found from near the shore to very deep waters.' +
        '  Young fis'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'h stay on sand or mud bottoms of bays and inshore are' +
        'as.  The li'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'ngcod is a voracious predator, eating many different ' +
        'fishes and '#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'octopuses.'#39'#10#10'#39'This fish changes color when stress' +
        'ed.  The flesh co'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'lor also changes, from a greenish hue when caught to ' +
        'white when '#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'cooked.'#39'#10#10'#39'Edibility is good; Lingcod is a popula' +
        'r sport and comme'#39' +'
      
        '          '#39'rcial fish.'#39'#10#10'#39'Range is Alaska to Northern Baja C' +
        'alifornia.'#39
